                "retweet_count": 7,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": ".@VP you inherited more Americans with health coverage than ever before and more lifesaving advancements in cancer research and disease prevention.\u00a0\n\nYou\u2019re cutting health care for millions of Americans and canceling cancer research to pay for billionaire tax breaks.",
