                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "When I left office as HHS Secretary, a record number of Americans had health insurance. \n\nNow we're heading in the wrong direction because the GOP decided to hold the ACA hostage.\n\nPremiums are going to skyrocket and many will ultimately forgo coverage. https://t.co/DIxucijZLo",
