                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 3,
                "retweet_count": 5,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Every day I served as HHS Secretary, we were laser-focused on driving down health insurance costs for the American people.\n\nOur work led to lower premiums and a record high level of Americans with coverage.\n\nMaybe this current administration could learn a thing or two. https://t.co/B1EF5iUzp0",
