                "text": "Check out this article from January of this year. The record level of ACA coverage that we achieved is now under attack.\n\nFewer Americans will have health insurance because of the GOP's reckless premium hikes.\n\nReopen the government and protect our care.\nhttps://t.co/OiF9H93f90",
